msgid "# KVPP"
msgstr "# KVPP"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid ""
"KVPP (KV pipeline parallelism) distributes historical KV caches that would "
"otherwise be replicated across TP ranks by layer for non-hybrid MLA/SFA "
"models. This reduces persistent cache storage per rank, allowing the same "
"HBM capacity to accommodate more context tokens or concurrent requests."
msgstr ""
"KVPP（KV 流水线并行）针对非混合 MLA/SFA 模型，将原本会在 TP rank 间复制的历史 KV 缓存按层进行分布。这减少了每个 rank "
"的持久化缓存存储，使相同的 HBM 容量能够容纳更多的上下文 token 或并发请求。"

msgid ""
"When a layer executes, the rank responsible for its cache broadcasts the "
"complete cache to the other ranks in the group. Model computation retains "
"its TP/EP/PP configuration. With PP enabled, each stage assigns caches and "
"broadcasts within its own cache-replica group. The group spans TP ranks, or "
"PCP × TP ranks when PCP is enabled on Model Runner V2, and never crosses DP "
"replicas or PP stages."
msgstr ""
"当某一层执行时，负责其缓存的 rank 会将完整缓存广播到组内的其他 rank。模型计算保持其 TP/EP/PP 配置。启用 PP 时，每个 stage"
" 分配缓存并在其自身的缓存副本组内广播。该组跨越 TP rank，或在 Model Runner V2 上启用 PCP 时跨越 PCP × TP "
"rank，且绝不会跨越 DP 副本或 PP stage。"

msgid ""
"The pipeline parallelism in KVPP refers to KV cache storage and "
"communication, while model computation keeps the parallel configuration "
"described above. For the underlying layer-wise KV storage concept, see "
"**LayerSplit** in Z.ai's [Scaling Pain of Coding Agent Serving: Lessons from"
" Debugging GLM-5 at Scale](https://z.ai/blog/scaling-pain)."
msgstr ""
"KVPP 中的流水线并行指的是 KV 缓存的存储与通信，而模型计算保持上述并行配置。关于底层的按层 KV 存储概念，请参见 Z.ai 的 "
"[Scaling Pain of Coding Agent Serving: Lessons from Debugging GLM-5 at "
"Scale](https://z.ai/blog/scaling-pain) 中的 **LayerSplit**。"

msgid "## Use Cases"
msgstr "## 使用场景"

msgid ""
"KVPP primarily targets long-context and concurrent serving workloads limited"
" by KV cache capacity. By reducing duplicated caches within a TP group, it "
"stores more KV tokens within the same HBM budget. In the tests on 950DT "
"Products reported in the PR, cache capacity reached **6.25×** the disabled "
"configuration on a single node and **5.35×** with dual-node PP."
msgstr ""
"KVPP 主要面向受 KV 缓存容量限制的长上下文和并发服务负载。通过减少 TP 组内的重复缓存，它能在相同的 HBM 预算内存储更多的 KV "
"token。在 PR 中报告的 950DT 产品测试中，单节点上的缓存容量达到未启用配置的 **6.25×**，双节点 PP 下达到 "
"**5.35×**。"

msgid "| Workload | Value and selection criteria |"
msgstr "| 负载 | 价值与选择标准 |"

msgid ""
"| Long-document question answering and long-context inference | Accommodates"
" more KV tokens when historical caches consume substantial memory; actual "
"maximum context length also depends on model limits and other memory "
"overhead. |"
msgstr ""
"| 长文档问答与长上下文推理 | 当历史缓存占用大量内存时可容纳更多 KV token；实际最大上下文长度还取决于模型限制和其他内存开销。 |"

msgid ""
"| Concurrent requests | Provides more cache space for concurrent requests "
"within the same HBM budget; increased capacity does not imply a proportional"
" throughput increase. |"
msgstr "| 并发请求 | 在相同的 HBM 预算内为并发请求提供更多缓存空间；容量增加并不意味着吞吐量成比例增加。 |"

msgid ""
"| Multiple reusable long prefixes | Keeps more prefixes resident in HBM and "
"can reduce CPU cache loading when combined with pooling; see the performance"
" section for measurements and version scope. |"
msgstr "| 多个可复用的长前缀 | 使更多前缀常驻 HBM，与池化结合时可减少 CPU 缓存加载；测量结果和版本范围请参见性能部分。 |"

msgid ""
"| Sufficient cache capacity with minimum latency as the priority | Compare "
"broadcast overhead before enabling KVPP; non-pooling throughput decreased in"
" the reported tests. |"
msgstr "| 缓存容量充足且以最低延迟为优先 | 启用 KVPP 前请比较广播开销；在报告的测试中，非池化吞吐量有所下降。 |"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid ""
"Enable KVPP through `enable_kvpp` in `--additional-config`, using eager "
"mode:"
msgstr "通过 `--additional-config` 中的 `enable_kvpp` 启用 KVPP，并使用 eager 模式："

msgid ""
"Replace `<model-path>` with a supported MLA/SFA model path and select TP "
"according to model size and available devices. The KVPP group size follows "
"TP × PCP and requires no separate setting. With PCP disabled, TP=1 provides "
"no cache-sharing benefit across ranks."
msgstr ""
"将 `<model-path>` 替换为受支持的 MLA/SFA 模型路径，并根据模型大小和可用设备选择 TP。KVPP 组大小遵循 TP × "
"PCP，无需单独设置。在禁用 PCP 的情况下，TP=1 无法在 rank 间提供缓存共享收益。"

msgid ""
"If the launch command already contains `--additional-config`, merge "
"`enable_kvpp` into the existing JSON object."
msgstr "如果启动命令已包含 `--additional-config`，请将 `enable_kvpp` 合并到现有的 JSON 对象中。"

msgid "### Combining Features"
msgstr "### 组合特性"

msgid ""
"KVPP can be combined with EP, PP, chunked prefill, prefix caching, and "
"asynchronous scheduling. The following example uses an MoE model that "
"supports EP:"
msgstr "KVPP 可与 EP、PP、分块预填充、前缀缓存和异步调度组合使用。以下示例使用支持 EP 的 MoE 模型："

msgid ""
"Adjust the token budget and maximum number of sequences to device capacity "
"and workload."
msgstr "根据设备容量和负载调整 token 预算和最大序列数。"

msgid ""
"For PCP, set `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` and add `--prefill-context-"
"parallel-size` to the launch configuration. KVPP shares caches across PCP × "
"TP ranks; Model Runner V1 does not support KVPP with PCP."
msgstr ""
"对于 PCP，请设置 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` 并在启动配置中添加 `--prefill-context-"
"parallel-size`。KVPP 在 PCP × TP rank 间共享缓存；Model Runner V1 不支持带 PCP 的 KVPP。"

msgid ""
"For PP, add `enable_kvpp` to the existing PP launch configuration. Each "
"stage allocates its caches independently. KVPP does not change PP layer "
"partitioning."
msgstr ""
"对于 PP，请将 `enable_kvpp` 添加到现有的 PP 启动配置中。每个 stage 独立分配其缓存。KVPP 不会改变 PP 的层划分。"

msgid ""
"Fixed-step MTP can be combined with KVPP, but MTP caches remain "
"independently allocated and are excluded from KVPP layer partitioning. "
"Follow the model-specific configuration requirements for MTP launch "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"固定步长 MTP 可与 KVPP 组合使用，但 MTP 缓存仍独立分配，并被排除在 KVPP 的层划分之外。MTP 启动参数请遵循模型特定的配置要求。"

msgid "## Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "## 配置参数"

msgid "| Parameter | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 默认值 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `additional_config.enable_kvpp` | `false` | Enables KVPP; the group size "
"follows TP × PCP. |"
msgstr ""
"| `additional_config.enable_kvpp` | `false` | 启用 KVPP；组大小遵循 TP × PCP。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enforce-eager` | Not enabled | Required for KVPP; graph execution is "
"not currently supported. |"
msgstr "| `--enforce-eager` | 未启用 | KVPP 必需；当前不支持图执行。 |"

msgid ""
"KVPP broadcasts each full layer once. No broadcast granularity or separate "
"KVPP parallel size needs to be configured."
msgstr "KVPP 对每个完整层广播一次。无需配置广播粒度或单独的 KVPP 并行大小。"

msgid "## Support and Constraints"
msgstr "## 支持与约束"

msgid "| Area | Scope |"
msgstr "| 领域 | 范围 |"

msgid ""
"| Models and runners | Non-hybrid MLA/SFA models; Model Runner V1 and V2 |"
msgstr "| 模型与 Runner | 非混合 MLA/SFA 模型；Model Runner V1 和 V2 |"

msgid ""
"| Parallelism and scheduling | TP, EP, PP, chunked prefill, prefix caching, "
"asynchronous scheduling |"
msgstr "| 并行与调度 | TP、EP、PP、分块预填充、前缀缓存、异步调度 |"

msgid ""
"| KV cache layouts | Allocated from actual specifications, including LI-C8 "
"and SFA-C8 |"
msgstr "| KV 缓存布局 | 根据实际规格分配，包括 LI-C8 和 SFA-C8 |"

msgid ""
"| Speculative decoding | Fixed-step MTP; variable-step MTP and other "
"speculative decoding methods are not supported |"
msgstr "| 投机解码 | 固定步长 MTP；不支持可变步长 MTP 及其他投机解码方法 |"

msgid "| Execution mode | Eager mode only; graph execution is not supported |"
msgstr "| 执行模式 | 仅支持 eager 模式；不支持图执行 |"

msgid ""
"| Context parallelism | PCP requires Model Runner V2; DCP is not supported |"
msgstr "| 上下文并行 | PCP 需要 Model Runner V2；不支持 DCP |"

msgid ""
"| KV pooling | Memcache with `AscendStoreConnector`, `kv_producer`, "
"asynchronous whole-block loading; PCP disabled |"
msgstr ""
"| KV 池化 | 使用 `AscendStoreConnector` 的 Memcache、`kv_producer`、异步整块加载；禁用 PCP |"

msgid ""
"| PD disaggregation | `MooncakeConnectorV2`; enable KVPP on the prefill node"
" only; PCP disabled |"
msgstr "| PD 分离 | `MooncakeConnectorV2`；仅在 prefill 节点上启用 KVPP；禁用 PCP |"

msgid ""
"Feature combinations must also meet the requirements of the model and the "
"individual features."
msgstr "特性组合还必须满足模型及各单独特性的要求。"

msgid "### PD Disaggregation"
msgstr "### PD 分离"

msgid ""
"Use `MooncakeConnectorV2` with `kv_producer` on the prefill node and "
"`kv_consumer` on the decode node. Enable KVPP only on the prefill node. MTP "
"caches remain replicated and are transferred alongside the persistent target"
" caches."
msgstr ""
"在 prefill 节点上使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 和 `kv_producer`，在 decode 节点上使用 "
"`kv_consumer`。仅在 prefill 节点上启用 KVPP。MTP 缓存保持复制，并与持久化目标缓存一起传输。"

msgid ""
"Each worker uses a handshake port derived from `kv_port` and its parallel "
"rank. Choose non-overlapping port ranges when both nodes run on one host."
msgstr "每个 worker 使用由 `kv_port` 及其并行 rank 派生的握手端口。当两个节点运行在同一主机上时，请选择不重叠的端口范围。"

msgid "### Memcache Pooling"
msgstr "### Memcache 池化"

msgid ""
"Configure the memcache SDK and MetaService as described in [KV "
"Pool](kv_pool.md), then add:"
msgstr "按照 [KV Pool](kv_pool.md) 中的说明配置 memcache SDK 和 MetaService，然后添加："

msgid ""
"This role both saves and loads pooled prefixes. Keep "
"`discard_partial_chunks=true` (the default). Layerwise pooling, KV events, "
"`kv_consumer`, `kv_both`, and consumer write-back are not supported with "
"KVPP."
msgstr ""
"该角色既保存也加载池化前缀。请保持 `discard_partial_chunks=true`（默认值）。KVPP 不支持分层池化、KV "
"事件、`kv_consumer`、`kv_both` 以及消费者回写。"

msgid ""
"Each TP rank saves one complete object per token block containing its "
"persistent target layers and its own MTP caches. Scratch buffers are "
"excluded. Loading restores those same persistent buffers; the existing KVPP "
"broadcast supplies other ranks when a layer executes. Pool lookup requires "
"every nonempty owner shard across all PP stages."
msgstr ""
"每个 TP rank 为每个 token block 保存一个完整对象，其中包含其持久目标层及其自身的 MTP "
"缓存。临时缓冲区不包含在内。加载时会恢复这些相同的持久缓冲区；当某一层执行时，现有的 KVPP 广播会为其他 rank 提供数据。池查找要求所有 PP "
"阶段中的每个非空 owner 分片都存在。"

msgid "## Performance"
msgstr "## 性能"

msgid ""
"The following measurements on 950DT Products from [PR "
"#16094](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16094) show the "
"impact on cache capacity, time to first token (TTFT), and prefill "
"throughput. The single-node and dual-node deployments use different "
"quantized weights; compare KVPP on and off within each deployment."
msgstr ""
"以下来自 [PR #16094](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16094) 的 "
"950DT Products 测量结果展示了其对缓存容量、首 token 时延（TTFT）和 prefill "
"吞吐量的影响。单节点和双节点部署使用不同的量化权重；请在每种部署内对比 KVPP 开启和关闭的情况。"

msgid "### Test Configuration"
msgstr "### 测试配置"

msgid "| Setting | Single node | Dual-node PP |"
msgstr "| 设置 | 单节点 | 双节点 PP |"

msgid ""
"| Hardware | One node with 8 950DT Products | Two nodes with 8 950DT "
"Products per node |"
msgstr "| 硬件 | 一个节点，配备 8 个 950DT Products | 两个节点，每个节点配备 8 个 950DT Products |"

msgid "| Model | GLM-5.2-W4A8C8 | GLM-5.2-W8A8C8-mxfp8 |"
msgstr "| 模型 | GLM-5.2-W4A8C8 | GLM-5.2-W8A8C8-mxfp8 |"

msgid "| Parallelism | TP8 + EP | TP8 + PP2 + EP, 38/40 layer split |"
msgstr "| 并行方式 | TP8 + EP | TP8 + PP2 + EP，38/40 层切分 |"

msgid ""
"| Common settings | DSA-CP, chunked prefill, prefix caching, asynchronous "
"scheduling, LI-C8, Model Runner V1, eager mode | Same as single node |"
msgstr ""
"| 通用设置 | DSA-CP、chunked prefill、前缀缓存、异步调度、LI-C8、Model Runner V1、eager 模式 | "
"与单节点相同 |"

msgid ""
"| Scheduling and memory | `max_num_batched_tokens=32768`, `max_num_seqs=12`,"
" `gpu_memory_utilization=0.90` | Same as single node |"
msgstr ""
"| 调度与内存 | "
"`max_num_batched_tokens=32768`、`max_num_seqs=12`、`gpu_memory_utilization=0.90`"
" | 与单节点相同 |"

msgid ""
"MTP, SFA-C8, and FlashComm1 were not enabled. This section presents the 32K "
"token-budget results; see the PR for the complete 16K token-budget "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"未启用 MTP、SFA-C8 和 FlashComm1。本节展示 32K token 预算的结果；完整的 16K token 预算对比请参见该 PR。"

msgid "### KV Cache Capacity"
msgstr "### KV 缓存容量"

msgid ""
"The service calculated capacity automatically without a block-count "
"override. Single-node values come from the pooling test configuration; dual-"
"node values come from non-pooling service startup logs."
msgstr "服务在未覆盖 block 数量的情况下自动计算容量。单节点数值来自池化测试配置；双节点数值来自非池化服务启动日志。"

msgid ""
"| Deployment | KVPP disabled (tokens) | KVPP enabled (tokens) | Capacity "
"multiplier | Equivalent KV memory savings at the same token capacity |"
msgstr ""
"| 部署 | KVPP 关闭（tokens） | KVPP 开启（tokens） | 容量倍数 | 相同 token 容量下的等效 KV 内存节省 |"

msgid "| Single node | 235,008 | 1,467,904 | 6.25× | 83.99% |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | 235,008 | 1,467,904 | 6.25× | 83.99% |"

msgid "| Dual-node PP | 555,392 | 2,972,416 | 5.35× | 81.32% |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | 555,392 | 2,972,416 | 5.35× | 81.32% |"

msgid ""
"Equivalent KV memory savings are estimated from the capacity ratio and do "
"not represent the same reduction in total HBM usage. Each rank still needs "
"two scratch buffers and independent MTP caches, so capacity gains depend on "
"layer count, TP size, PP partitioning, and per-layer cache sizes."
msgstr ""
"等效 KV 内存节省是根据容量比例估算的，并不代表总 HBM 使用量有相同幅度的降低。每个 rank 仍然需要两个临时缓冲区和独立的 MTP "
"缓存，因此容量收益取决于层数、TP 大小、PP 切分以及每层缓存大小。"

msgid "### Time to First Token"
msgstr "### 首 token 时延"

msgid ""
"Prefix cache hit rate was 0%, with 1 output token. Each result is the mean "
"TTFT of 4 requests at client concurrency 1. A positive change indicates "
"increased latency."
msgstr "前缀缓存命中率为 0%，输出 1 个 token。每个结果为客户端并发数为 1 时 4 个请求的平均 TTFT。正值变化表示时延增加。"

msgid ""
"| Deployment | Input length | KVPP disabled | KVPP enabled | TTFT change |"
msgstr "| 部署 | 输入长度 | KVPP 关闭 | KVPP 开启 | TTFT 变化 |"

msgid "| Single node | 32K | 2.623 s | 2.614 s | -0.33% |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | 32K | 2.623 s | 2.614 s | -0.33% |"

msgid "| Single node | 64K | 5.295 s | 5.375 s | +1.52% |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | 64K | 5.295 s | 5.375 s | +1.52% |"

msgid "| Single node | 128K | 10.901 s | 11.268 s | +3.36% |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | 128K | 10.901 s | 11.268 s | +3.36% |"

msgid "| Dual-node PP | 32K | 2.900 s | 2.905 s | +0.19% |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | 32K | 2.900 s | 2.905 s | +0.19% |"

msgid "| Dual-node PP | 64K | 4.503 s | 4.887 s | +8.53% |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | 64K | 4.503 s | 4.887 s | +8.53% |"

msgid "| Dual-node PP | 128K | 7.805 s | 8.665 s | +11.01% |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | 128K | 7.805 s | 8.665 s | +11.01% |"

msgid "### Non-Pooling Prefill Throughput"
msgstr "### 非池化 Prefill 吞吐量"

msgid ""
"Each run contained 40 requests at client concurrency 12, with 128K input "
"tokens and 1 output token per request. KV pooling was disabled in both "
"configurations."
msgstr ""
"每次运行包含 40 个请求，客户端并发数为 12，每个请求有 128K 输入 token 和 1 个输出 token。两种配置均禁用了 KV 池化。"

msgid ""
"| Deployment | Prefix cache hit rate | KVPP disabled (input tokens/s) | KVPP"
" enabled (input tokens/s) | Throughput change |"
msgstr ""
"| 部署 | 前缀缓存命中率 | KVPP 关闭（输入 tokens/s） | KVPP 开启（输入 tokens/s） | 吞吐量变化 |"

msgid "| Single node | 0% | 12,492.4 | 12,205.7 | -2.30% |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | 0% | 12,492.4 | 12,205.7 | -2.30% |"

msgid "| Single node | 90% | 116,516.2 | 110,224.8 | -5.40% |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | 90% | 116,516.2 | 110,224.8 | -5.40% |"

msgid "| Dual-node PP | 0% | 21,395.2 | 18,742.3 | -12.40% |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | 0% | 21,395.2 | 18,742.3 | -12.40% |"

msgid "| Dual-node PP | 90% | 177,375.4 | 154,717.3 | -12.77% |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | 90% | 177,375.4 | 154,717.3 | -12.77% |"

msgid ""
"The actual hit rate in all 90% scenarios was 89.9414%. Under these "
"workloads, KVPP increased cache capacity while adding broadcast overhead; "
"non-pooling throughput did not improve."
msgstr ""
"所有 90% 场景中的实际命中率均为 89.9414%。在这些工作负载下，KVPP 增加了缓存容量，同时也带来了广播开销；非池化吞吐量并未提升。"

msgid "### Pooled Prefill Throughput with Multiple Prefixes"
msgstr "### 多前缀下的池化 Prefill 吞吐量"

msgid ""
"These measurements use the pooling test version (vllm-ascend `493ec2b`, vLLM"
" `b2f6858`). KV transfer integration is complete but is not included in this"
" submission. The integration code and usage configuration will be merged in "
"a follow-up submission."
msgstr ""
"这些测量使用池化测试版本（vllm-ascend `493ec2b`，vLLM `b2f6858`）。KV "
"传输集成已完成，但未包含在本次提交中。集成代码和使用配置将在后续提交中合并。"

msgid ""
"Both KVPP configurations enabled `AscendStoreConnector` with the Memcache "
"backend, `kv_role=kv_both`, `use_layerwise=false`, and `load_async=true`. "
"CPU pool capacity was configured as 32 GB per device."
msgstr ""
"两种 KVPP 配置均启用了使用 Memcache 后端的 `AscendStoreConnector`，并设置 "
"`kv_role=kv_both`、`use_layerwise=false` 和 `load_async=true`。CPU 池容量配置为每设备 32"
" GB。"

msgid ""
"The scenario uses multiple reusable long prefixes. The total warmed prefix "
"data exceeded HBM KV capacity in both configurations. HBM caches were "
"retained after warmup, and both configurations used identical request data "
"and ordering. Each run contained 40 requests at client concurrency 12, with "
"128K input tokens, approximately 90% shared prefix, and 1 output token per "
"request."
msgstr ""
"该场景使用多个可复用的长前缀。两种配置中预热的前缀数据总量均超过了 HBM KV 容量。预热后保留了 HBM "
"缓存，且两种配置使用相同的请求数据和顺序。每次运行包含 40 个请求，客户端并发数为 12，每个请求有 128K 输入 token、约 90% "
"共享前缀和 1 个输出 token。"

msgid ""
"- Single node: 16 prefix families were warmed; measurement used 8 families with 4 requests each and another 8 families with 1 request each.\n"
"- Dual node: 32 prefix families were warmed; measurement used 16 families with 2 requests each and 8 families with 1 request each. The remaining 8 families were used only for warmup."
msgstr ""
"- 单节点：预热了 16 个前缀族；测量使用了 8 个族各 4 个请求，以及另外 8 个族各 1 个请求。\n"
"- 双节点：预热了 32 个前缀族；测量使用了 16 个族各 2 个请求，以及 8 个族各 1 个请求。其余 8 个族仅用于预热。"

msgid ""
"| Deployment | Configuration | Throughput (input tokens/s) | HBM cache hit "
"rate | CPU pool cache hit rate | Throughput change |"
msgstr "| 部署 | 配置 | 吞吐量（输入 tokens/s） | HBM 缓存命中率 | CPU 池缓存命中率 | 吞吐量变化 |"

msgid "| Single node | KVPP disabled | 66,362.5 | 8.46% | 81.48% | — |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | KVPP 关闭 | 66,362.5 | 8.46% | 81.48% | — |"

msgid "| Single node | KVPP enabled | 97,318.3 | 45.46% | 44.48% | +46.65% |"
msgstr "| 单节点 | KVPP 开启 | 97,318.3 | 45.46% | 44.48% | +46.65% |"

msgid "| Dual-node PP | KVPP disabled | 86,438.8 | 0.59% | 89.35% | — |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | KVPP 禁用 | 86,438.8 | 0.59% | 89.35% | — |"

msgid ""
"| Dual-node PP | KVPP enabled | 125,699.3 | 53.87% | 36.07% | +45.42% |"
msgstr "| 双节点 PP | KVPP 启用 | 125,699.3 | 53.87% | 36.07% | +45.42% |"

msgid ""
"Cache hit rates use all input tokens as the denominator; the combined HBM "
"and CPU hit rate was 89.94% in all configurations. With KVPP enabled, more "
"prefixes remained in HBM and the share loaded from the CPU pool decreased, "
"improving prefill throughput by approximately 45%–47% in this scenario."
msgstr ""
"缓存命中率以所有输入 token 为分母；在所有配置下，HBM 与 CPU 的综合命中率为 89.94%。启用 KVPP 后，更多前缀保留在 HBM "
"中，从 CPU 池加载的比例下降，在此场景下将 prefill 吞吐量提升了约 45%–47%。"

msgid ""
"All throughput values are total input tokens divided by measurement "
"duration, including cached tokens. They do not represent the throughput of "
"recomputed tokens or decode performance for long outputs. Every throughput "
"run completed 40/40 requests without preemption. Percentages are calculated "
"from unrounded measurements. Both dual-node configurations used the same "
"temporary NFS forwarding route, with model loading and warmup completed "
"before measurement."
msgstr ""
"所有吞吐量数值均为总输入 token 数除以测量时长，包含已缓存的 token。它们不代表重新计算 token 的吞吐量，也不代表长输出的 decode"
" 性能。每次吞吐量测试均完成 40/40 个请求且未发生抢占。百分比基于未取整的测量值计算。两种双节点配置均使用相同的临时 NFS "
"转发路由，模型加载与预热均在测量前完成。"

msgid "## Usage Recommendations"
msgstr "## 使用建议"

msgid ""
"Evaluate KVPP first on workloads limited by KV cache capacity. Compare "
"capacity, TTFT, and throughput with KVPP on and off using realistic input "
"lengths, concurrency, and prefix distributions, then select a configuration "
"that meets the service latency requirements."
msgstr ""
"对于受 KV 缓存容量限制的工作负载，应优先评估 KVPP。使用真实的输入长度、并发量和前缀分布，对比启用与禁用 KVPP 时的容量、TTFT "
"和吞吐量，然后选择满足服务延迟要求的配置。"

msgid ""
"Broadcasts transfer all allocated logical blocks of a layer without "
"filtering for active requests, so increasing cache capacity also increases "
"broadcast volume. Prefetching can overlap part of the communication with "
"computation, but the benefit remains workload-dependent. When cache capacity"
" is already sufficient, use measured latency and throughput to decide "
"whether to enable KVPP."
msgstr ""
"广播会传输某一层所有已分配的逻辑块，而不会按活跃请求进行过滤，因此增加缓存容量也会增加广播数据量。预取可以将部分通信与计算重叠，但收益仍取决于具体工作负载。当缓存容量已经足够时，应根据实测的延迟和吞吐量来决定是否启用"
" KVPP。"
